NAME
  ioctl - KNUCK syscall

SYNOPSIS
  ioctl(fd, request, arg)

DESCRIPTION
  Device control. VT_ACTIVATE: switch terminal. TCSETS: 'cooked'|'raw' on /dev/console. TIOCSCTTY: set controlling tty.

RETURN VALUES
  true or nil

SEE ALSO
  open

KNUCK(2) manual page. Part of the KNUCK kernel distribution.
